<p>Judge each dish against the brief: <b>recipe selection</b> (did it meet the client’s needs?), <b>ingredients and quantities</b> (portion, balance, cost), <b>techniques</b>, <b>nutritional value</b> (analysis vs targets), <b>presentation and serving</b>, <b>taste</b>, and <b>suitability for audience and purpose</b>.</p>
